// Append-only log of changes to core/ (named core-2/ until 2026-11-09; earlier entries say so). Newest entry last. One entry per act on core;
// what each entry says is what changed and why, so that core carries no history of its own.
// KDL 2.0. A value containing " is a raw string, #"like this"#.
// The `by` here is typed, against the model's own rule that an actor is read from the harness; this log predates any tool that could read it.

