  why "Joseph, 2026-11-09: what the verisectorium claims as better as a whole is made from determinants but not in equal part; in AAT correctness under stated conditions, fruitfulness and novelty of primary claims far outweigh notational coherence or citation fidelity, and a paper carved from a subgraph reweights them; so the weight is on segment kind x determinant and depends on the purpose"
}

