entry at="2026-11-09T16:35-07:00" by="Fable 5.2 session, after Joseph's correction and a fork's second pass" {
  did #"three things from the first core that make the model better are in: veritoid's working notes ask, as one decision for Joseph, what a version covers (softening an assertion now lapses the checks of the content; reconciling cascades; restoring revives; a reflow should mint nothing), with a lean; segment's notes say that "gap" has no meaning in the model though this outline uses it, and that nothing holds a projection's order to anything; dimension's Definition states the cap as an equation (effective warrant is the least of own and the targets' effective warrants, a missing target the lowest) and reference's note ties acyclicity to that equation having one solution. Cut as recording only that something once existed: notes on act and verisectorium, three sub-items on dimension, the bounds half of kind's note (which gains the empty-ground conflict with its own invariant). The outline's "Deliberately not carried" ledger, which sat under Working Notes and said kernel-spike material was left out "on your word", is replaced by a short Historical Context that says nothing was left out as a class."#
